{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":60,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “The Lily of the Covenant.” A teaching poem by David, when he fought with Aram Naharaim and with Aram Zobah, and Joab returned, and killed twelve thousand of Edom in the Valley of Salt."},{"n":1,"text":"God, you have rejected us. You have broken us down. You have been angry. Restore us, again.","tok":[{"t":"God, "},{"t":"you","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" rejected "},{"t":"us","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"You","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" broken "},{"t":"us","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"down","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"You","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" been angry. Restore "},{"t":"us","s":["H5921"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"again","s":["H3925"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"You have made the land tremble. You have torn it. Mend its fractures, for it quakes.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H8147"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"made","s":["H5221"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5221"]},{"t":" land tremble. "},{"t":"You","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H8147"]},{"t":" torn "},{"t":"it","s":["H7725"]},{"t":". Mend "},{"t":"its","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" fractures, "},{"t":"for","s":["H8147"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"it","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" quakes."}]},{"n":3,"text":"You have shown your people hard things. You have made us drink the wine that makes us stagger.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" have shown "},{"t":"your","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" people hard things. "},{"t":"You","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" have "},{"t":"made","s":["H6555"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"us","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" drink "},{"t":"the","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" wine "},{"t":"that","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" makes "},{"t":"us","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" stagger."}]},{"n":4,"text":"You have given a banner to those who fear you, that it may be displayed because of the truth. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" given "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" banner "},{"t":"to","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"those","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" fear "},{"t":"you","s":["H3588"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"that","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"it","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" may "},{"t":"be","s":["H4131"]},{"t":" displayed "},{"t":"because","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H7667"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" truth. Selah."}]},{"n":5,"text":"So that your beloved may be delivered, save with your right hand, and answer us.","tok":[{"t":"So","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"that","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" beloved "},{"t":"may","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" delivered, save "},{"t":"with","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" right hand, "},{"t":"and","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" answer "},{"t":"us","s":["H7200"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"God has spoken from his sanctuary: “I will triumph. I will divide Shechem, and measure out the valley of Succoth.","tok":[{"t":"God","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"has","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" spoken "},{"t":"from","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" sanctuary: “"},{"t":"I","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" triumph. "},{"t":"I","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"divide","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" Shechem, "},{"t":"and","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" measure "},{"t":"out","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" valley "},{"t":"of","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" Succoth."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Gilead is mine, and Manasseh is mine. Ephraim also is the defense of my head. Judah is my scepter.","tok":[{"t":"Gilead "},{"t":"is","s":["H3225"]},{"t":" mine, "},{"t":"and","s":["H6032"]},{"t":" Manasseh "},{"t":"is","s":["H3225"]},{"t":" mine. Ephraim also "},{"t":"is","s":["H3225"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3467"]},{"t":" defense "},{"t":"of","s":["H3225"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H3467"]},{"t":" head. Judah "},{"t":"is","s":["H3225"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H3467"]},{"t":" scepter."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Moab is my wash basin. I will throw my sandal on Edom. I shout in triumph over Philistia.”","tok":[{"t":"Moab "},{"t":"is","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" wash basin. I will throw "},{"t":"my","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" sandal "},{"t":"on","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" Edom. I shout "},{"t":"in","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"triumph","s":["H5937"]},{"t":" over Philistia.”"}]},{"n":9,"text":"Who will bring me into the strong city? Who has led me to Edom?","tok":[{"t":"Who","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" bring me "},{"t":"into","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H4519"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"strong","s":["H4581"]},{"t":" city? "},{"t":"Who","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"has","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" led me "},{"t":"to","s":["H3063"]},{"t":" Edom?"}]},{"n":10,"text":"Haven’t you, God, rejected us? You don’t go out with our armies, God.","tok":[{"t":"Haven’t "},{"t":"you","s":["H5921"]},{"t":", God, rejected "},{"t":"us","s":["H5921"]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"You","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" don’t go "},{"t":"out","s":["H7993"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"with","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"our","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" armies, God."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Give us help against the adversary, for the help of man is vain.","tok":[{"t":"Give us help "},{"t":"against","s":["H5892"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" adversary, "},{"t":"for","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" help "},{"t":"of","s":["H5892"]},{"t":" man "},{"t":"is","s":["H4310"]},{"t":" vain."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Through God we will do valiantly, for it is he who will tread down our adversaries.","tok":[{"t":"Through","s":["H3318"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"we","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H6635"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"do","s":["H3318"]},{"t":" valiantly, "},{"t":"for","s":["H6635"]},